+#     old_path: row-major over the 3x3 destination
+#     new_path: a single fixed clockwise spiral that starts at the destination's top-left corner,
+#       walks around the outer ring, and ends at the center
+#     order:
+#       - (cr-1, cc-1)
+#       - (cr-1, cc)
+#       - (cr-1, cc+1)
+#       - (cr, cc+1)
+#       - (cr+1, cc+1)
+#       - (cr+1, cc)
+#       - (cr+1, cc-1)
+#       - (cr, cc-1)
